<title>UK: Rolls-Royce says foreign holding 27.06 pct.</title>
<headline>Rolls-Royce says foreign holding 27.06 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Rolls-Royce Plc said on Thursday that its level of foreign ownership had reached 27.06 percent.</p>
<p>The company's articles of association permit foreign shareholding to be no more than 29.5 percent, it said.</p>
<p>The company did not give its previous level of foreign holding.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
